# CVE-2026-14456 (libssl3t64 / openssl-provider-legacy, HIGH): the
# trixie-20260824-slim base image predates this fix landing in
# trixie-security (already patched upstream, at 3.5.7-1~deb13u2 vs this
# image's baked-in 3.5.6-1~deb13u2). Accepted rather than adding an
# `apt-get upgrade` step to the Dockerfile -- that would make the build
# depend on whatever's newest in the live apt archive at build time
# instead of being reproducible purely from the pinned DEBIAN_VERSION/
# SAMBA_VERSION args. Expect the next DEBIAN_VERSION bump to include the
# fix already baked into a newer base image snapshot; re-check trivy then
# and drop this line if it's clean.
CVE-2026-14456 exp:2026-12-11
